<title>LEBANON: Beirut Stock Exchange authorises new broker.</title>
<headline>Beirut Stock Exchange authorises new broker.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Beirut Stock Exchange has authorised Credit Libanais bank to operate as a broker from October 7, the stock exchange announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The addition of Credit Libanais raised to 11 the number of authorised brokers on the Beirut Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 861723</p>
</text>
